Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Create bounded search, recount, relabel, inspection, or transfer tasks using approved warehouse procedures. Sequence dependencies and require independent confirmation for consequential inventory adjustments or uncertain identity changes.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
